INSERT INTO component_mcq (question) VALUES ('You made a mistake at work today — a small one, but visible. In the hours that follow, you notice the internal voice: the one that replays the moment, questions your competence, and compares you to others who seem to handle things more easily. You know this voice well. You are wondering how to respond to it.');
