-- Component 2 for Card 4
INSERT INTO component_text (content) VALUES ('You are at the end of this module. You have reflected on your energy patterns, your boundaries, your inner voice, and the habits that actually fit your life. You now have a clearer picture of what self-care means for you — not in theory, but in practice. The question is: what will you take with you when the next demanding week arrives?');
